Rule 5 (input must be at least 1-D so a valid axis can exist)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 6 (exclusive and reverse must be boolean flags)
{v_3 : bool, v_4 : bool} |= (v_3 = true ∨ v_3 = false) ∧ (v_4 = true ∨ v_4 = false)
