Rule 8 (axis as integer must be within valid range)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= -1 * ndim(v_1) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 ≤ ndim(v_1) - 1
>>
Rule 10 (axis as tensor must be within valid range)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= -1 * ndim(v_1) ≤ min(v_2) ∧ max(v_2) ≤ ndim(v_1) - 1
>>
Rule 11 (exclusive is a boolean)
{v_1 : bool} |= v_1 = true ∨ v_1 = false
